<title>POLAND: BETON STAL DECREASES LOSS IN MAY.</title>
<headline>BETON STAL DECREASES LOSS IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.30 vs   0.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.45 vs   0.26</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.62 vs   0.25</p>
<p> Sales		    4.08 vs   1.48</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.98 vs   0.39 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.21 vs   0.39 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.25 vs   0.45 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   25.92 vs   3.98</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Beton</p>
<p>Stal SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
